# @auki/$crate_package_name

wasm-bindgen JavaScript bindings for `auki-registry`.

```js
import init, { frameRosBodyJson, frameEntryHash } from "./$generated_js_file";

await init();

const frameJson = frameRosBodyJson("K1-AABBCCDDEEFF/base_link");
const frameHash = frameEntryHash(frameJson);
```

The package exposes web-safe JCS-canonical JSON and hash adapters for Sensor,
Clock, Frame, and Detector Registry entries. Filesystem read/write helpers are
native-only and intentionally not exported from the wasm package.
